</style></head><body data-track="/api/track" data-slug="k7m2xq" data-version="ver_0001"><div class="page t-menu-board deco-line-art"><main class="menu-board"><figure class="m-hero"><img src="media/img_menu01-display.webp" alt="美式咖啡" width="750" height="500" class="m-hero-img" fetchPriority="high" decoding="async"/></figure><section class="m-board" aria-label="菜单"><header class="m-header"><h1 class="fh m-shop" data-fact="shop.name">巷口咖啡</h1><p class="fh m-headline">巷口的第一杯</p><p class="m-subhead">早上好，从一杯热咖啡开始</p></header><div class="deco-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div><ul class="m-list"><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0001.name">美式咖啡</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0001.price">¥18</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0001.price.unit">杯</span></span></div><div class="m-detail"><p class="m-spec" data-fact="items.m1aa0001.spec">大杯 473ml</p><p class="m-blurb">清爽不苦，配什么都好。</p></div></li><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0002.name">拿铁</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0002.price">¥22.50</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0002.price.unit">杯</span></span></div><div class="m-detail"><p data-fact="items.m1aa0002.description">意式浓缩加热牛奶。</p></div></li><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0003.name">燕麦拿铁</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0003.price">¥25</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0003.price.unit">杯</span></span></div></li><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0004.name">柠檬气泡美式</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0004.price">¥26</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0004.price.unit">杯</span></span></div><div class="m-detail"><ul class="tags"><li class="tag" data-fact="items.m1aa0004.tags.0">夏季限定</li></ul></div></li><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0005.name">可颂</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0005.price">¥12.50</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0005.price.unit">个</span></span></div></li><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0006.name">肉桂卷</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0006.price">¥16</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0006.price.unit">个</span></span></div></li><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0007.name">芒果千层</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0007.price">¥32</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0007.price.unit">份</span></span></div><div class="m-detail"><p class="m-blurb">层层叠叠的芒果香。</p></div></li><li class="m-row"><div class="m-line"><h3 class="fh m-name" data-fact="items.m1aa0008.name">巧克力布朗尼</h3><span class="m-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="price m-price"><span data-fact="items.m1aa0008.price">¥18.80</span><span class="price-unit" data-fact="items.m1aa0008.price.unit">块</span></span></div></li></ul><div class="m-claims"><ul class="claims"><li class="claim" data-fact="extraClaims.0">自家烘焙豆子</li><li class="claim" data-fact="extraClaims.1">可外带</li></ul></div></section><ul class="m-strip" aria-label="商品照片"><li><img src="media/img_menu02-thumb.webp" alt="拿铁" width="240" height="240" class="m-thumb" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></li><li><img src="media/img_menu03-thumb.webp" alt="燕麦拿铁" width="240" height="240" class="m-thumb" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></li></ul><p class="closing">路过的话，进来坐坐。</p></main><section class="shop-info" aria-label="店铺信息"><dl><div><dt>营业时间</dt><dd data-fact="shop.hours">周一至周日 7:30-19:00</dd></div><div><dt>地址</dt><dd data-fact="shop.address">杭州市西湖区文三路 12 号</dd></div><div><dt>电话</dt><dd data-fact="shop.phone">13800001234</dd></div><div><dt>微信</dt><dd data-fact="shop.wechat">xiangkou-coffee</dd></div></dl></section><details class="fix"><summary>信息有误？告诉老板</summary><form id="sz-fix" data-api="/api/corrections" noValidate=""><label>哪一项有误<select name="field"><option value="items.m1aa0001.name">美式咖啡 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0001.price">美式咖啡 · 价格</option><option value="items.m1aa0001.spec">美式咖啡 · 规格</option><option value="items.m1aa0002.name">拿铁 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0002.price">拿铁 · 价格</option><option value="items.m1aa0002.description">拿铁 · 介绍</option><option value="items.m1aa0003.name">燕麦拿铁 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0003.price">燕麦拿铁 · 价格</option><option value="items.m1aa0004.name">柠檬气泡美式 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0004.price">柠檬气泡美式 · 价格</option><option value="items.m1aa0005.name">可颂 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0005.price">可颂 · 价格</option><option value="items.m1aa0006.name">肉桂卷 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0006.price">肉桂卷 · 价格</option><option value="items.m1aa0007.name">芒果千层 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0007.price">芒果千层 · 价格</option><option value="items.m1aa0008.name">巧克力布朗尼 · 名称</option><option value="items.m1aa0008.price">巧克力布朗尼 · 价格</option><option value="shop.name">店名</option><option value="shop.phone" data-nv="1">电话联系不上或有误</option><option value="shop.wechat" data-nv="1">微信联系不上或有误</option><option value="shop.address">地址</option><option value="shop.hours">营业时间</option><option value="other">其他</option></select></label><label id="sz-fix-v">正确的是<input maxLength="100" autoComplete="off" name="sv"/></label><label>补充说明（选填）<textarea name="note" maxLength="200" rows="2"></textarea></label><p class="fix-tip">请勿填写你的手机号等个人信息</p><button type="submit">提交</button><p id="sz-fix-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden=""><span>已转告老板，谢谢你</span><span>提交失败，请稍后再试</span><span>请勿填写个人信息</span><span>请填写正确的内容</span></p></form></details><footer class="footer"><p>本页由 AI 辅助设计，商品信息由商家提供</p><p>由 实招 Shizhao 生成</p></footer></div><nav class="actions" aria-label="联系商家"><a class="act" href="tel:13800001234" data-act="call">一键拨号</a><button class="act" type="button" data-act="wechat_copy" data-copy="xiangkou-coffee">复制微信号</button><a class="act" href="https://surl.amap.com/abc123" data-act="navigate" rel="noopener noreferrer">地图导航</a></nav><p id="sz-toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden=""><span>已复制</span><span hidden="">请长按微信号手动复制</span></p><script>(function(){
